        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auxin is a thrilling multiplayer party game that offers intense battles, both locally and online, where treelings compete fiercely for the coveted golden seed. Players will experience the excitement of swinging through beautifully crafted pixel art nature-themed maps using a simple yet challenging liana mechanic. They can shoot, plant, or intercept seeds to outsmart their opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and skill-based battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Auxin, treelings can face off against each other in Arena mode, using a wide array of moves with their lianas. Every projectile in the game takes the form of seeds that can be strategically planted in the maps for future use, resulting in dynamic and strategically rich battles filled with breathtaking turnarounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 unique maps themes, each featuring distinctive seeds and hazards, players must tap into their creativity to utilize the environment to their advantage, all in the pursuit of claiming the golden seed and achieving victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Auxin is a thrilling multiplayer party game that offers intense battles, both locally and online, where treelings compete fiercely for the coveted golden seed. Players will experience the excitement of swinging through beautifully crafted pixel art nature-themed maps using a simple yet challenging liana mechanic. They can shoot, plant, or intercept seeds to outsmart their opponents.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/b890f0da2d0d46f8ce8b95f0c9619e50.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Intense and skill-based battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Auxin, treelings can face off against each other in Arena mode, using a wide array of moves with their lianas. Every projectile in the game takes the form of seeds that can be strategically planted in the maps for future use, resulting in dynamic and strategically rich battles filled with breathtaking turnarounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/22f1c2a7d8b174a8d2115b94ca4e7213.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master Your Environment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 unique maps themes, each featuring distinctive seeds and hazards, players must tap into their creativity to utilize the environment to their advantage, all in the pursuit of claiming the golden seed and achieving victory.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.poster.avif?t=1756144256\" width=800 height=408 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.webm?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2601450/extras/2e3ff41c9365e35ae6bbae930a43a1c6.mp4?t=1756144256\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
